 r←Test_Misc_028(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;sourceFolder;linkconfigFile;linkOptions;watchSetting;rc;msg
⍝ Exercise `ProcessLinkOptions`: which settings of the LINK section in the project config reach Link.
⍝ From 0.46.0 on, the LINK section was ignored unless a file .linkconfig carried Link options,
⍝ and a -watch= setting never reached Link at all.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 3 ⎕MKDIR tempDir,'/APLSource'
 sourceFolder←##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/Link.Config'
 linkconfigFile←tempDir,'/APLSource/.linkconfig'
 1 ⎕NDELETE linkconfigFile                 ⍝ In case an earlier run failed

⍝ No .linkconfig: the LINK section is passed on
 (linkOptions watchSetting)←tempDir ∆ProcessLinkOptions 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp'none'≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.watch}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.forceFilenames}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp'none'≢watchSetting

⍝ No .linkconfig, but -watch= specified: that wins
 (linkOptions watchSetting)←tempDir ∆ProcessLinkOptions'dir'
 →T.GoToTidyUp'dir'≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.watch}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.forceFilenames}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp'dir'≢watchSetting

⍝ .linkconfig with nothing but stops: the LINK section is still passed on
 linkconfigFile ⎕NCOPY sourceFolder,'/.linkconfig-2'
 (linkOptions watchSetting)←tempDir ∆ProcessLinkOptions 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp'none'≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.watch}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.forceFilenames}linkOptions

⍝ .linkconfig with Link options: the LINK section is ignored, but -watch= still wins
 linkconfigFile ⎕NCOPY⍠('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢sourceFolder,'/.linkconfig-3'
 (linkOptions watchSetting)←tempDir ∆ProcessLinkOptions 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp ⍬≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.forceFilenames}linkOptions
 →T.GoToTidyUp ⍬≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.watch}linkOptions
 (linkOptions watchSetting)←tempDir ∆ProcessLinkOptions'dir'
 →T.GoToTidyUp'dir'≢{6::⍬ ⋄ ⍵.watch}linkOptions

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
